## Why This Project Stays Private

This codebase represents years of iterative development — from a lightweight billing utility to an AI-native operations platform. The business logic embedded across six major versions is the result of deep domain knowledge, real-world operational feedback, and countless hours of refinement.

The following are NOT included in any public grant:

- The database schemas for accounting, billing, GST, and subscriber management
- The financial calculation logic (balance computation, due tracking, payment reconciliation)
- The AI system prompt architecture and multi-step agent pipeline
- The LE GeX knowledge graph entity mappings
- The ISP/telecom Radius integration patterns
- The GST compliance workflows and tax calculation rules
- The SMS automation and billing reminder logic
- The role-based permission model and integration access control

These are not trivial to replicate. They are the product of direct operational experience, not theoretical design.

